        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Abumaengc kauh Guangc ta",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Abumaengc, kauh Guangc ta thuanc o!",
            "Kakhou nang thuanh phungc guang o;",
            "Thuaklou, kuaklou, tiigaylou e,",
            "Kakumhmei baihmei maek ge.",
            "Pou ta thuanc o! Pou ta thuanc o!",
            "Tingsaengzaeng Guangc ta thuanc o!",
            "",
            "2 Zauzian thaymeipu ta thuanc o;",
            "’Niu pu-pouc ta zianmei kumc,",
            "’Tau nic Kamei kalaih mak ge,",
            "Riap khang ’zaeng, zauzian padik;",
            "Pou ta thuanc o! Pou ta thuanc o!",
            "Hymdaihmeipu ta thuanc o!",
            "",
            "3 Pu kumc ’niu ta makav bam e,",
            "’Niw ramsuan Kamei thay e;",
            "Kaziwna Kamei zaylou e,",
            "Zauczihmei khou {:1 gaeklou;",
            "Pou ta thuanc o! Pou ta thuanc o!",
            "Zauzian Kaipouc ta thuanc o!",
            "",
            "4 Pou zaw how bammei baanch’ra thiu,",
            "Pou ta thuanh khang ’khavlou o!",
            "Bw, Neih, Gaanchuangcna guay {:1 nic",
            "’Khum keyna Kata kalum;",
            "Pou ta thuanc o! Pou ta thuanc o!",
            "Zian thaymeipu ta thuanc o!"
          ]
        }
      },
